CKA Scenario: Add Sidecar Container to Existing Deployment
Context
You are working in a Kubernetes cluster where an existing Deployment named mrapp-deployment is already running.

Your task is to update this Deployment by adding a co-located container (sidecar pattern) inside the same Pod.

Objective
Modify the existing Deployment mrapp-deployment and:

Add a new container named sidecar

Use the image: busybox:stable

Configure the container to run the following command: /bin/sh -c "tail -f /var/log/mrapp.log"

Ensure the sidecar container can access the log file mrapp.log
